        "As a requirement to graduate all participants must show proof of a High School diploma or G.E.D. If a participant cannot show proof of a High School Diploma or G.E.D. upon entering Intervention Court they will be expected to start work towards obtaining one and must have obtained it to be considered for graduation from Intervention Court.",
