        "Monitors compliance with the Alyce Griffin Clarke Intervention Court Act(Miss. Code Ann. §9-23-1 through §9-23-51), the Mississippi Intervention Court Rules, the ten key components of Intervention Courts as published by the USDJ, and the Adult Intervention Court Best Practice Standards from the NADCP.",
