        "Presides over and actively participates in all intervention court hearings or sessions.",
        "Provides opportunity for team members to speak in staffing, as appropriate.",
        "Reinforces treatment through the ordering of incentives and sanctions.",
        "Knows participants by name, encourages them to succeed, and emphasizes treatment within the program.",
