        "Advocates for public safety and for timely and effective incentives and sanctions of participants. Participates in the decision to promote or dismiss participants.",
        "Prepares and files termination/probation revocation/suspended sentence complaints after the decision to terminate/revoke has been made with consultation by the intervention court team.",
